{
    "title": "Build Craft: Master Block 3D",
    "description": "Craft your own world, one block at a time, in Build Craft: Master Block 3D, the exciting new crafting game that lets you build anything you can imagine!\r\nVast, procedurally generated landscapes: From lush forests and sun-drenched beaches to towering mountains and mysterious caves, the world of Build Craft: Master Block 3D is yours to discover. \r\nUnique biomes and hidden secrets: Each biome offers its own challenges and rewards. Uncover ancient ruins, encounter friendly creatures, and battle dangerous foes as you explore every corner of the world. \r\nBuild anything you can dream of: From humble cottages to sprawling castles, intricate machines to awe-inspiring works of art, the possibilities are endless. \r\nGather resources and craft tools: Mine for precious ores, chop down trees, and hunt for food. Use your newfound materials to craft weapons, armor, tools, and decorations. \r\nCustomize your experience: Choose your character's appearance, personalize your home, and even design your own custom items.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Craft your own world, one block at a time, in Build Craft: Master Block 3D, the exciting new crafting game that lets you build anything you can imagine!<br>Vast, procedurally generated landscapes: From lush forests and sun-drenched beaches to towering mountains and mysterious caves, the world of Build Craft: Master Block 3D is yours to discover. <br>Unique biomes and hidden secrets: Each biome offers its own challenges and rewards. Uncover ancient ruins, encounter friendly creatures, and battle dangerous foes as you explore every corner of the world. <br>Build anything you can dream of: From humble cottages to sprawling castles, intricate machines to awe-inspiring works of art, the possibilities are endless. <br>Gather resources and craft tools: Mine for precious ores, chop down trees, and hunt for food. Use your newfound materials to craft weapons, armor, tools, and decorations. <br>Customize your experience: Choose your character&#39;s appearance, personalize your home, and even design your own custom items.",
